  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.10.7: Gateway hardening — WebSocket write serialization via SemaphoreSlim (fixes concurrent SendAsync race causing disconnects). _ws field made volatile to prevent JIT-cached stale references; all send/receive methods capture _ws locally to eliminate TOCTOU races. ConnectSocketAsync defers _ws assignment until connection succeeds. 26 missing dispatch cases added to HandleDispatch (VoiceStateUpdate, PresenceUpdate, TypingStart, WebhooksUpdate, InviteCreate, InviteDelete, GuildIntegrationsUpdate, AutoModeration*, StageInstance*, GuildScheduledEvent*, Integration*, VoiceServerUpdate, GuildJoinRequest*, PollVote*). 7 new TryEmit* helpers + 20 handler methods with full wiring through DiscordBot, ShardManager, and DiscordEvents. UpdatePresencePayload.since now uses [JsonIgnore(Condition = Never)] — Discord requires the since field present even when null. BotActivity.url uses [JsonIgnore(Condition = WhenWritingNull)] to omit null for non-streaming activities. DefaultIgnoreCondition = WhenWritingNull added to source-gen options. Fixed AOT serialization — ApplicationCommandDefinition[] no longer boxed to object[]. Close frame reason now logged; Disconnected event fires before auto-reconnect. Added WithGatewayDebug() opt-in diagnostic logging for all outgoing gateway payloads. Optional status parameter added to SetGameAsync/SetWatchingAsync/SetListeningAsync/SetStreamingAsync/SetCompetingAsync. ActivityType enum gap at value 4 documented. Write lock and gateway debug flag threaded through Shard, ShardManager, DistributedWorker, DiscordBotOptions.",
